<title>NORWAY: SOCCER-NORWAY BEAT FINLAND 3-0 IN EUROPEAN U-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-NORWAY BEAT FINLAND 3-0 IN EUROPEAN U-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>SOGNDAL, Norway 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway beat Finland 3-0</p>
<p>(halftime 1-0) in a European under-21 soccer championship group</p>
<p>three qualifier on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Arild Sundgot 43, Thorstein Helstad 49, Daniel Berg</p>
<p>Hestad 87.</p>
<p>Attendance: 2,000</p>
</text>
